01:41:38.300 --> 01:41:39.821
- [Andrew] The tuna dish for example--

01:41:39.821 --> 01:41:42.348
- [Greg] Exactly yeah, that
tuna dish is influenced by

01:41:42.348 --> 01:41:44.844
Peruvian cuisine, first
